      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-10-05T04:18:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We couldn\u0027t inspect these previously because they were part of the encrypted portion of the payload. Now we can verify that they are formatted as (A) map { tstr : [ +bstr ]} and (B) that the array of bstrs is composed of valid X509 certificates terminating in the signature of the UDS_Public_Key. We cannot check that the particular root for the chain is recognized though.",
